(What It Does) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 638 Tm
(- Runs week-by-week decision gameplay with two choices per card.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 625 Tm
(- Tracks four pillars \(bandwidth, salary, reputation, life\) with clamped values 0-100.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 612 Tm
(- Applies deterministic game rules for promotion and game-over outcomes.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 599 Tm
(- Seeds and stores card content locally in IndexedDB.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 586 Tm
(- Supports persona-aware and anti-repeat card selection with optional seeded RNG.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 573 Tm
(- Provides admin tools to list/edit/delete cards and configure promotion settings.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 560 Tm
(- Imports/exports cards as JSON for backup and bulk updates.) Tj
