1 0 0 1 54 541 Tm
(How It Works \(Repo Evidence\)) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 528 Tm
(- UI layer: React + React Router routes '/' for gameplay and '/admin' for tooling.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 515 Tm
(- State layer: GameProvider \(useReducer + effects\) orchestrates init, decision, draw, and persistence.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 502 Tm
(- Engine layer: pure TypeScript modules \(effects, gameState, promotion, cardSelector\) compute outcomes.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 489 Tm
(- Persistence layer: idb-backed IndexedDB stores cards, current game state, and promotion settings.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 476 Tm
(- Data flow: Intro persona -> card drawn -> choice -> effects applied -> status checked -> state saved.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 463 Tm
(- External backend/API service: Not found in repo.) Tj
